  "structure": {
    "block_count": 56,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Past Your Due Date? These Restaurant Meals Might Just Kickstart Labor",
        "text_sha256": "d5368bcf89cf5ca9b312d2021866b48ecc3a08e36771d8f2246b34c9d534cc8c",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, sources, and formatting.",
        "text_sha256": "2bf448333081ffc8549a45a6c4b7fc711ee4b93575f0fffd3c4a6212c13581c2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Labor inducing restaurant meals",
        "text_sha256": "1885e5dc883e6e026c3e0e75bdc777180fd4fcc0b7729c6c894287a3c609091e",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Moms around the country swear by these dishes for speeding up labor.",
        "text_sha256": "7b5a4bb6a71dca4efc92cb62d11d95c0a2d2f0f7ddedc8b6e5f1850ae6b0a7b3",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "When the big day should be days away (or should have been days ago), and baby's not budging, any old wives' tale seems worth a try. But rather than waiting around for baby to make her arrival, why not get dressed up one last time and dine out?",
        "text_sha256": "ae5514434295c8a8eaa291ea132c95e25276f7dedab71e627b7225495e94f6cd",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "While experts will tell you there's no proof that so-called labor-inducing foods can jumpstart the birthing process, thousands of mamas beg to differ. “My water broke spontaneously after a day of walking, sex, and some slices of a super spicy jalapeño,” reported What to Expect Community member allier0120 . Many parents even credit specific restaurant meals with fast-tracking baby's arrival.",
        "text_sha256": "8c9e1cdfe143df5605a81d37ec851cfb04148dcc475cccd551fbadc29bca5ca9",
        "word_count": 60
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Below, seven legendary labor-inducing meals you can find at restaurants from the Atlantic to the Pacific.",
        "text_sha256": "a791030eb408cb5650e1fad7ce1e0ead65d2d84b55e85cc9cddfb93ac5e959ec",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key-Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "c2a9bcce7698ee0702f3d963a8b82556c80a5c4c5eff821a1c928b50c51d08da",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "It's a fun tradition. While certain restaurant meals are rumored to help move things along, there's no scientific proof that foods help start labor.",
        "text_sha256": "27ecd65c946b5a57c81c9a5e1e966e392a9da83ccf542d1793f7842fa7b45fe0",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Spicy and hearty foods top the list. Rich meals with kick like spicy tacos, buffalo pizza, or Lobster Francaise are frequently mentioned by moms-to-be.",
        "text_sha256": "c3f76000878e27857cb5920d93b8b9ae93159da1c8112a10ab78abf786039189",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Your body knows best. Once labor starts, stick to easy-to-digest foods and stay hydrated to make childbirth as comfortable as possible.",
        "text_sha256": "3cdc259ed7fb36a9046f07241c3575184f2cd48bde65af0b22223a983758f479",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "'Prego Pizza' from Skipolini's",
        "text_sha256": "cafbb1e1179c9d1f10365f306e582f32df1006a64006cbf4dec83c608829f9f9",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If anything can get baby out, perhaps it's a four-pound pizza baby. With six locations in California and one in Nevada, Skipolini's Pizza , sees as many as 10 expectant moms each night for their famous Preggo Pizza.",
        "text_sha256": "7f6a6024dcfb5c3a4817c5e6f64e29cad2eee9d66124b43da4a041241c8d39c8",
        "word_count": 38
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "As the story goes, back in 1981, a pregnant woman asked to be served whatever would get her baby out. The manager delivered a monster pie with 13 toppings, including six types of meat and extra onions and garlic. Later that evening, her water broke.",
        "text_sha256": "35f0fc5f82aa70c30e521ca203ec1a8146e815b8b1fcf7d01f7d7932679a64e1",
        "word_count": 45
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Now, there are dozens of success stories — baby photos and all — listed on the restaurant's website. At the very least, you won't leave hungry.",
        "text_sha256": "d36edc45785d69939b7be012c0bfb96f95469aa0a6a784781a4ad551758dda0a",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "'The Inducer' from Hawthorne's New York Pizza & Bar",
        "text_sha256": "c9fa10a15b515c096140c11a524d0bf20bdb13b7d56db0b712d2b3b288a7219d",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A single slice of The Inducer allegedly helped break one woman's water, and many more moms report to this Charlotte, North Carolina pizza joint for a final kick of flavor, according to The Charlotte Observer . With chicken, mozzarella cheese, and Hawthorne's medium-hot buffalo sauce, this pizza will jumpstart your digestive system — and, according to some pregnant diners, trigger contractions too.",
        "text_sha256": "a2b78b6cd4dba4696f8cce6e89ae8d8bb5f882eee4c36a67b07e3b24c6ce69e7",
        "word_count": 62
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "'Maternity Salad' from Caioti Pizza Café",
        "text_sha256": "962df66c80a62342fc69e8414e0e5371e1785adf5c5ac6ce04fd8b2821873b7a",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Seeking something slightly healthier for your pre-delivery meal? Caioti Pizza Café in Studio City, California has been serving up its Maternity Salad to hungry moms-to-be for some 30 years now. The salad's ingredients seem pretty basic (romaine lettuce, watercress, walnuts, and pasteurized gorgonzola cheese), but the dressing is a well-protected family secret.",
        "text_sha256": "035b9ed8bca927fe2a6c6fdba0f26486e5a06f6abd814cc873c532c60a661362",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "It even has the Hollywood stamp of approval: Hilary Duff gave it a shot, and the Today Show's Carson Daly and wife Siri even had it delivered to New York City before baby number two arrived.",
        "text_sha256": "3bd99aeaf0ac0efb09952cfca3d8f0b562bc7be772a2f9237141bd0bbc510a10",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Have more questions about delivery or recovery? Find trusted answers and personalized support in the What to Expect app .",
        "text_sha256": "815831f8a7bbbc59a94501a5f7e358fbbef46c0e9ac0ab8eb1c691f63e622ab3",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Shrimp quesadillas from Las Margaritas",
        "text_sha256": "50087b9003ddce89b583157c1dd86629e6b7e3231d55b1d62826ab1f1797ffba",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "While restaurant owner Alberto Roman makes no big deal out of his Gainesville, Florida restaurant's shrimp quesadillas, a handful of mamas insist they do the trick .",
        "text_sha256": "a59f657e7cbec9aaaeddda06481339c821010a68b35e354160bbaadc5ee2d2da",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Spicy foods have long been considered possible labor-inducers, yet this quesadilla is on the mild side (think: cheese, grilled shrimp, onions, bell peppers, and tomatoes with a side of guacamole salad, sour cream, and rice or beans). Perhaps it's the jalapeño peppers in the pico de gallo that get baby ready to go, muses Roman.",
        "text_sha256": "fda4a6a3c7af11c54a086125e4b7d35554416a295c5dbb6ce2fec994b4f57d3d",
        "word_count": 55
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Lobster Française from Henry's Salt of the Sea",
        "text_sha256": "90181e2cb919a8f7822f6ecc892e1d2da15d0ff6ff0c87bc705b00942eb9edda",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Enter Henry's Salt of the Sea in Allentown, Pennsylvania with a bulging belly, and owner Randy Maurer will serve you up his signature dish: Lobster Francaise. This is one you'll want to devour. Egg-battered cold water lobster tails are finished off with mushrooms, tomatoes, capers, and loads of butter.",
        "text_sha256": "8a72c1f069cec665da0f831a00088f1de1a5b1dd0808f46a87adc9c28feb3456",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you're past your due date, perhaps you'll join the ranks of the two dozen or so women who swear this dish sent them straight to the delivery room.",
        "text_sha256": "b3abc1e594c33b82ffc87b39d8a7a64c6b03dbe055445b63a8e557e01d559a35",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Spicy tacos from Loco Taqueria & Oyster Bar",
        "text_sha256": "83c5833a72ea41d920289d33eea2fd11cb7847e5a126654d963d4eaafdb0b27e",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Some South Boston women swear that spicy food is the ticket to a newborn baby, flocking to Loco Taqueria & Oyster Bar for spicy tacos and chips from the taqueria. Credit, perhaps, goes to a secret recipe for the spices on pretty much every dish on the menu, chef Matt Drummond tells CBS Boston . If it doesn't work, who can complain about one last night out on the town? Loco just so happens to be one of the most happening spots in Southie.",
        "text_sha256": "e42c586360b6cd83ad32bca9c1389c87cb048b4e3c15b796edf5f8f0c4fee8bd",
        "word_count": 84
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Anything from Taco Bell",
        "text_sha256": "99e40851b77d2fc0effd2e734c5e465671ca7f8539575c5b2a6dd664853bc89c",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "No matter where you are, readers in the What to Expect Community have shared that a quick meal from Taco Bell may just take you over the finish line. One new mother writes, “I had Taco Bell yesterday, unknowingly, and had my baby girl this morning! I guess it's worth a try!” Another mama wrote that the chain's Volcano Tacos with extreme hot sauce are your best bet.",
        "text_sha256": "52a40ed7462d833aa54847bbfe8fd84860bbc1a74363956c59829df614401211",
        "word_count": 68
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Just remember: Once you've entered early labor, skip the fatty foods and stick to easy-to-digest snacks like toast or plain pasta with lots of water (staying hydrated is key!).",
        "text_sha256": "f70eade6b5be019888f6a5df79a594e89a254c689517e110f6b23ed8fddf799c",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "WhatToExpect.com, Can Certain Foods Induce Labor? , April 2022. The Charlotte Observer, Is the Buffalo Wing Pizza at Hawthorne’s New York Pizza & Bar inducing labor? , October 2019. E! News, Hilary Duff Is Trying to Induce Her Labor—With a Special Salad , October 2018. The Gainesville Sun, Past Due Having Your Baby? Shrimp Quesadillas May Help , August 2012. CBS Boston, Women Claim South Boston Restaurant's Spicy Food Helped Induce Labor , May 2017. WhatToExpect.com, The 3 Stages of Labor: What Happens and When , October 2025.",
        "text_sha256": "a8e099b983ac59391ee8cc0ff62c714fb46b33cd02d81806ed5525588612f7ac",
        "word_count": 88
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Updates history",
        "text_sha256": "8ce5f24a37ab68e01743f0cb3f0234dd767a31a441e3e3be35047619722ffec6",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "December 3, 2025",
        "text_sha256": "3bb78478de108ea63735b0b5f22e28632ddd883beedd30445c9e8d394ebd2dec",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Editor: Lisa Lombardi/Catherine Donaldson-Evans",
        "text_sha256": "a2949b23ad83e69e7773220086be22222a21550e9909134b23e35fc801494e5a",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
